      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Habitats",
          "lines": [
            "Any warm land",
            "Marshes and swamps"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A relatively normal lizard scaled up to 15 feet long, with a low body, four walking legs, and a long tail."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Combat mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Jaw trap · An attack score of 20 traps the victim in its mouth. The bite doubles to 2–16, then deals 2–16 damage each round thereafter."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Behavior mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Swamp hunter · It attacks edible creatures that wander by. Black dragons share its swamps. Lizardfolk sometimes domesticate it as a mount, pack animal, or food."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "2–12 (2d6) appearing. Uncommon. Solitary organization. Day activity. Carnivorous and neutral.",
            "No intelligence (0). Treasure Nil. Average (8–10) morale. Magic resistance Nil.",
            "Monstrous Manual, TSR 2140, January 1994 third printing, p. 226."
          ]
        }
      ],
