          "title": "Habitats",
          "lines": [
            "Tropical hills and mountains",
            "Areas near copper and red dragons"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A 40-foot lizard with sharp claws and teeth. The male has display horns resembling those of a minotaur."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Combat mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Ambush · Opponents take a −5 penalty on their surprise rolls.",
            "Jaw trap · An attack roll of 20 traps the victim in its jaws. It deals 3–18 damage automatically each round thereafter until the victim escapes or dies. The victim cannot attack the following round.",
            "Display horns · The male’s horns are believed to attract a mate. Its attacks use claws and teeth."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "1–8 appearing. Rare. Solitary organization. Day activity. Carnivorous and neutral.",
            "No intelligence (0). Treasure J–N, Q, C (magic). Average (8–10) morale. Magic resistance Nil.",
            "Monstrous Manual, TSR 2140, January 1994 third printing, p. 226."
          ]
        }
