          "title": "Habitats",
          "lines": [
            "Any subterranean terrain",
            "Caves with walls and ceilings it can climb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A 20-foot lizard with suction pads on its toes for crossing walls and ceilings. Some cave forms are albino. Other forms have a long tongue."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Combat mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Jaw clamp · An attack roll of 20 traps the victim in its jaws and doubles the bite to 4–24. The trapped victim automatically takes 2–12 additional damage each following round."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Printed variants mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Albino form · Some forms are albino, shun light, and attack at −1 in daylight or its equivalent.",
            "Long-tongued form · Other forms have tongues up to 20 feet long. A seized man-sized or smaller victim is drawn into its mouth and bitten next round unless a bend bars roll succeeds."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Behavior mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Cave movement · It can run across walls and ceilings and does not leave its cave voluntarily."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "1–6 appearing. Uncommon. Solitary organization. Day activity. Carnivorous and neutral.",
            "No intelligence (0). Treasure O, P, Q (×5). Average (8–10) morale. Magic resistance Nil.",
            "Monstrous Manual, TSR 2140, January 1994 third printing, p. 226."
          ]
        }
